<title>HONG KONG: HK weather-cloudy,showers, bright periods,max 28 C.</title>
<headline>HK weather-cloudy,showers, bright periods,max 28 C.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>It will be cloudy with a few showers, the Royal Observatory said on Thursday.</p>
<p>There will be bright periods during the day.</p>
<p>The maximum temperature will be about 28 C.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m., the temperature was 24 C and the relative humidity 97 per cent, the observatory said.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
